| **GL redundancy perception** | "Why not just use Financial Dimensions and Management Reporter?" |
| **Maintenance burden** | Ongoing effort to keep hierarchies, policies, data in sync |
| **Limited out-of-box content** | Few templates or pre-built configurations |
| **Integration gaps** | Not well integrated with SCM costing, GIA, or Project Accounting |

