| **Cost Book Setup** | Create/edit cost books; assign policy templates | Book status, processing health |
| **Valuation Overview** | (Read-only) | Inventory value by book; period-over-period trends |
| **Book Comparison** | Select books to compare | GAAP vs. IFRS differences; drill-down to item level |
| **Cost Elements** | Review cost element breakdown | Inventory value by component (material, freight, overhead) |
| **GL Posting Status** | View posting layer assignments | Which books post to which layers; posting health |

