## 6.3 Health Checks & Diagnostics

### Automated Health Checks

| Check | What It Detects | Recommended Action |
|-------|-----------------|-------------------|
| **Unmapped Cost Categories** | GL expense accounts not mapped to cost categories | Map accounts or exclude from costing |
| **Missing Allocation Sources** | Allocation rules pointing to empty cost centers | Check source data; adjust rule scope |
| **Book Divergence** | Cost books significantly different beyond expected policy differences | Drill down to understand differences |
| **Processing Lag** | Batch processing backlog > threshold | Check batch jobs; investigate errors |
| **Reconciliation Gaps** | Subledger doesn't match GL (for posting books) | Identify missing transactions; run reconciliation |
| **Statistical Measure Stale** | Measures not updated in X days | Check integration; refresh data |
| **Posting Layer Conflicts** | Multiple books posting to same layer | Review posting layer assignments |

